        "text": "82.1"
      },
      {
        "y": 71.2,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 491.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Look at A opposite. Explain what the underlined expressions with thing and get mean"
      },
      {
        "y": 83.2,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 234.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "in the following sentences."
      },
      {
        "y": 99.8,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 405.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "1 Don’t make such a big thing about it. I’m only going for a few days."
      },
      {
        "y": 111.8,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 504.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "2 Jess has got a thing about wanting straight hair, but her natural frizz suits her much better."
      },
      {
        "y": 123.8,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 332,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "3 The thing is, I don’t know when we’ll be at home."
      },
      {
        "y": 135.8,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 398.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "4 Unless things change, we won’t be able to get away for a holiday."
      },
      {
        "y": 147.8,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 382.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "5 We have a number of things to get through before lunchtime."
      },
      {
        "y": 159.8,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 506.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "6 I don’t get on with them very well. For one thing, we like different things. For another, I find"
      },
      {
        "y": 171.8,
        "x0": 127.6,
        "x1": 197.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "them quite rude."
      },
      {
        "y": 183.8,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 380.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "7 Did you get what the lecturer was saying? I didn’t get a thing."
      },
      {
        "y": 195.8,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 435.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "8 I hope we can get everything sorted out today. It’s time we got it together!"
      },
      {
        "y": 211.9,
        "x0": 78.5,
        "x1": 102,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "82.2"
      },
      {
        "y": 214.5,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 461.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "What words do you think the speaker is looking for in each of these sentences?"
      },
      {
        "y": 226.5,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 267.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Choose from the words in the box."
      },
      {
        "y": 247.4,
        "x0": 122.1,
        "x1": 426,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "colander hammer rolling pin protractor sieve Daniel Craig"
      },
      {
        "y": 268.2,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 437.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "1 Where’s the thingummy for sifting the flour so there aren’t any lumps in it?"
      },
      {
        "y": 280.2,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 440.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "2 Look, isn’t that whatsisname? The actor who was in the latest James Bond?"
      },
      {
        "y": 292.2,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 336.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "3 I can’t find the thingumibob for measuring angles."
      },
      {
        "y": 304.2,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 355.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "4 Have you got a whatsit, you know, for bashing in nails?"
      },
      {
        "y": 316.2,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 298.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "5 Where’s the thingy for draining potatoes?"
      },
      {
        "y": 328.2,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 453.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "6 I need a whatchamacallit – you know, one of those things for flattening pastry."
      },
      {
        "y": 344.2,
        "x0": 78.5,
        "x1": 102,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "82.3"
      },
      {
        "y": 346.8,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 493.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Look at the sentences in 82.2 again and find a different vague word from the one used"
      },
      {
        "y": 358.8,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 493.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "in the exercise, e.g. Where’s the whatchamacallit for sifting the flour so there aren’t any"
      },
      {
        "y": 370.9,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 165.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "lumps in it?"
      },
      {
        "y": 391.6,
        "x0": 78.5,
        "x1": 102,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "82.4"
      },
      {
        "y": 394.2,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 483.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Look at C. Rewrite the underlined parts of these sentences in a more informal style."
      },
      {
        "y": 410.8,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 370.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "1 The garden had great numbers of pink and yellow flowers."
      },
      {
        "y": 422.8,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 430.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "2 I’ve asked her out a great many times, but she’s always got some excuse."
      },
      {
        "y": 434.8,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 384.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "3 He hasn’t done any useful work here since he first got the job."
      },
      {
        "y": 446.8,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 345.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "4 I’ve got a large number of papers I want to get rid of."
      },
      {
        "y": 458.8,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 386.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "5 Alice invited a great many people to her party at the weekend."
      },
      {
        "y": 470.8,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 442.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "6 Yasmin’s got a great deal of energy – I don’t know where she gets it all from!"
      },
      {
        "y": 482.8,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 436.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "7 A great many people were turned away because the lecture room was full."
      },
      {
        "y": 494.8,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 396.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "8 She was told many times not to leave any valuables on her desk."
      },
      {
        "y": 510.9,
        "x0": 78.5,
        "x1": 102,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "82.5"
      },
      {
        "y": 513.5,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 307.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Look at D, and then fill the gaps in this text."
      },
      {
        "y": 539.1,
        "x0": 127.8,
        "x1": 393.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "This is a very boring party, present 1 excepted, of course."
      },
      {
        "y": 551.1,
        "x0": 127.8,
        "x1": 401.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "No one, myself 2 , seems to be making much of an effort to"
      },
      {
        "y": 563.1,
        "x0": 127.8,
        "x1": 401.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "chat. I 3 a lot of people couldn’t come. 4 , no"
      },
      {
        "y": 575.1,
        "x0": 127.8,
        "x1": 406.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "5 intended, but don’t you think you could have dressed a bit"
      },
      {
        "y": 587.1,
        "x0": 127.8,
        "x1": 407.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "more smartly? If you don’t 6 me saying so, I think you should"
      },
      {
        "y": 599.1,
        "x0": 127.8,
        "x1": 387.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "have changed out of your gardening clothes. I mean that in the nicest"
      },
      {
        "y": 611.1,
        "x0": 127.8,
        "x1": 244,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "7 way, of course!"
      },
      {
        "y": 640.1,
